  band: WHAT THE RUN FOUND (pinned in `expected`; measured, not argued).
  Antoine log10(Psat/bar) = 4.783236 - 2119.1665/(T + -34.8668),
  in-sample R2 0.998031 over 23 points, 383.16-478.18 K. HELD OUT: 21
  points, AAD 105.1167 % against the band 5.3 % -> notValidated. Its own
  normal boiling point (101.325 kPa): 478.44 K. NOT PROMOTED: held-out
