  3.531990 - 1207.1399/(T + -135.3400), in-sample R2 0.995897 over 23
  points, 383.16-478.18 K. HELD OUT: 21 points, AAD 34.1314 % (max
  55.8176 %) against the band 5.3 % -> notValidated; the stage-1
