  measured, not argued). Objective twoStage. Antoine log10(Psat/bar) =
  4.018870 - 1504.3419/(T + -101.9840), in-sample R2 0.999789 over 44
  kept points, 287.1-478.18 K (10.1021/acs.jced.6b00517 23/23 kept;
  10.1016/j.jct.2008.02.012 21/21 kept). Relative error in P over the
