  own normal boiling point (101.325 kPa): 476.84 K. NOT PROMOTED by the
  DEFAULT acceptance of DEV.md 4c C283 (no system/curationDict): 2
  studies, 44 points kept, 0 discarded as outliers; max relative error
  8.817 % (mean 4.223 %) against 5 %; AmbroseWalton on the same points
  mean 10.87 % / max 27.25 %; the record keeps AmbroseWalton
  @@EARLIER-END@@

  NO MEASURED POINT IS IN THIS TREE: constant/archiveDatasets declares every
  series by DOI, NIST URL and sha256; `bin/choupo-curate fetch` regenerates
  them into constant/archiveExtracts/ (gitignored).

